---
title: "About · VORNAC"
description: "About VORNAC: team, mission, and careers in continuous penetration testing and AI security, with German data residency where it matters."
i18nKey: about
ogType: website
bodyClass: about-page
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block extraHead %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/about.css">
{% set schemaType = "AboutPage" %}{% set schemaAboutOrg = true %}
{% include "partials/page-schema.njk" %}
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<main>
    <section id="{{ t.aboutAnchors.company }}" class="about-company">
        <div class="about-company-inner">
            <div class="about-company-copy">
                <h1 class="about-company-headline">Re-engineering <em>cybersecurity.</em></h1>
                <p class="about-company-text">
                    VORNAC, based in Heidelberg, reimagines proactive security. We rethink business processes while holding to what matters most right now: German data sovereignty.
                </p>
                <p class="about-company-text">
                    We bridge the gap between technical necessity, strict compliance, and the increased security needs of our time.
                </p>
                <p class="about-company-meta">Heidelberg, Germany</p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-founders">
                <div class="about-founders-frame">
                    <picture>
                        <source type="image/webp" srcset="/founders-award.webp">
                        <img src="/founders-award.jpg" alt="André Feigenbutz and Arthur Raess, VORNAC founders" width="1600" height="1165" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
                    </picture>
                </div>
                <p class="about-founders-caption"><span id="arthur-raess">Arthur Raess</span> · <span id="andre-feigenbutz">André Feigenbutz</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="{{ t.aboutAnchors.careers }}" class="about-careers">
        <div class="about-careers-inner">
            <div class="about-careers-head">
                <h2 class="about-careers-headline">Join the VORNAC team</h2>
                <p class="about-careers-lead">Want to build the future of German data sovereignty, not just talk about it?</p>
                <p class="about-careers-sub">We're looking for talent to shape the future of cybersecurity with us.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-jobs">
                <article class="about-job">
                    <h3 class="about-job-title">Data Scientist</h3>
                    <div class="about-job-tags">
                        <span class="about-job-tag">Heidelberg / Remote</span>
                        <span class="about-job-tag">Full-time</span>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="about-job-block-title">Your mission</h4>
                    <ul class="about-job-list">
                        <li>Advance the models and agents that plan attack chains and rate findings</li>
                        <li>Build and curate training and evaluation data from real penetration tests</li>
                        <li>Measure model quality, analyse failure cases and feed the results back into the product cycle</li>
                    </ul>
                    <h4 class="about-job-block-title">You bring</h4>
                    <ul class="about-job-list">
                        <li>Degree in computer science, mathematics, statistics or a related field</li>
                        <li>Hands-on experience with LLMs, agent systems or reinforcement learning in Python</li>
                        <li>Interest in offensive security, prior knowledge is a plus</li>
                        <li>Fluent in German and English</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="{{ pageUrls.apply }}?position=data-scientist" class="about-job-cta">Apply now</a>
                </article>

                <article class="about-job about-job--alt">
                    <h3 class="about-job-title">Pentester as Customer Success Manager</h3>
                    <div class="about-job-tags">
                        <span class="about-job-tag">Heidelberg / Remote</span>
                        <span class="about-job-tag">Full-time</span>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="about-job-block-title">Your mission</h4>
                    <ul class="about-job-list">
                        <li>Support customers with penetration testing results &amp; consulting</li>
                        <li>Guide customers to success with your penetration testing expertise</li>
                        <li>Technical consulting &amp; remediation support</li>
                    </ul>
                    <h4 class="about-job-block-title">You bring</h4>
                    <ul class="about-job-list">
                        <li><strong>BSI Kompetenzanerkennung</strong> or equivalent</li>
                        <li>Hands-on penetration testing experience</li>
                        <li>Customer-oriented &amp; strong communication skills</li>
                        <li>Fluent in German and English</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="{{ pageUrls.apply }}?position=pentester-csm" class="about-job-cta">Apply now</a>
                </article>
            </div>

            <div class="about-careers-open">
                <p>Don't see the right role?</p>
                <a href="{{ pageUrls.apply }}?position=open-application">Apply anyway →</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="about-contact">
        <div class="about-contact-inner">
            <div class="about-contact-head">
                <h2 class="about-contact-headline">Ready to see <em>VORNAC</em> in action?</h2>
                <p class="about-contact-sub">A 30-minute live session with our team. Walk through a real-world execution and see the depth of our reports.</p>
                {% include "partials/hero-demo-button.njk" %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>
{% endblock %}

{% block extraBodyEnd %}
{% endblock %}
